{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026n0HSUHJdYQ1794756323.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國邁阿密國際機場發生客機與貨機在地面相撞事故，兩人輕傷。</p><p></p><p>美國傳媒報道，一架聯合包裹運送服務公司的波音767貨機，與一架巴拿馬航空公司的波音737客機在機場相撞。</p><p></p><p>機場方面表示，當地周六晚九時許，一架抵達的飛機和一架出發的飛機，在兩條滑行道的交匯處相撞，兩架飛機引導至其他滑行道，對機場運營沒有影響，兩名傷者毋須送院。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:05:03.842469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:23.708682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:57:00.212424+00:00","content_hash":"d58561d8dbc639251782267f4b7bb84cc6b3f62624acf3996d97f0172f081593","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:05:03.842469+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}